@startuml
title ATM Withdrawal Scenario

[*] --> ChooseOrEnterAmount
ChooseOrEnterAmount : entry / nil
ChooseOrEnterAmount : do / display predefined amounts
ChooseOrEnterAmount : do / allow user to input custom amount
ChooseOrEnterAmount : exit / [amount chosen or entered] ProceedWithdrawal

ProceedWithdrawal : entry / [amount chosen or entered]
ProceedWithdrawal : do / check account balance
ProceedWithdrawal : do / validate transaction limit
ProceedWithdrawal : exit / [transaction validated] WithdrawalProcessing
ProceedWithdrawal --> CancelTransaction : insufficient funds / invalid transaction
Cancellation : entry / user cancels transaction
Cancellation : exit / return card and end session
Cancellation --> [*]

WithdrawalProcessing : do / withdraw the amount
WithdrawalProcessing : exit / [amount withdrawn] ReturnCard

ReturnCard : entry / [amount withdrawn]
ReturnCard : do / return card
ReturnCard : exit / end session
ReturnCard --> [*]
@enduml
